}\b\fs24  \f2 "A good writer should be considerate towards his/her readers." Briefly explain with an example.\par
\b0 it means that when writer is writing something he or she should think who his reader is. What they want to read. The piece of writing should not be too hard or complicated for his readers to understand. It should have verity and interesting elements to keep the reader captivated.  \f0\par
\pard     \b\f2\par
