}\b\fs24  \b0\f2 Rewrite the following sentences by changing the word order as necessary.\par
\par
1.Up the stairs dashed the reporter.\par
The reporter dashed up the stairs.\par
\par
2. Onto the stage glided the ballerina.\par
The ballerina glided on the stage.\par
\par
3. Here is the butter.\par
The butter is here.\par
\par
4. There go the geese.\par
The geese is going there.\par
\par
5. To and fro rode the girl on the horse.\par
\pard\nowidctlpar\f0 The girl on the horse rode to and fro.\par
\par
